---
title: Michael Koper - Co-founder Nusii - Software Engineer
description: Michael Koper, a Dutch full-stack developer living in Madrid, Spain. Co-founder of Nusii, Online Proposal Software for Creative Businesses.

changefreq: "weekly"
priority: "1"
---

<img src="/images/michaelkoper.jpg" alt="" class="size-20 rounded-full outline-1 -outline-offset-1 outline-white/10">

<h1 class="mt-8 max-w-[30ch] text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-white sm:text-5xl">
  Hey, I'm Michael Koper
</h1>

<p class="mt-6 max-w-[48ch] text-pretty">
  I'm a Dutch software engineer living in Madrid, Spain. I'm building <a href="https://nusii.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-lime underline decoration-lime/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-lime">Nusii</a>, a SaaS to create beautiful online proposals, and I previously worked at <a href="https://cabify.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-lime underline decoration-lime/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-lime">Cabify</a> as employee #1.
</p>

<div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-5">
  <%= partial "social_links" %>
</div>

<section class="mt-20">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-white">Writing</h2>
  <ul role="list" class="mt-6 space-y-6">
    <% blog.articles.first(3).each do |article| %>
      <li>
        <article>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-balance"><%= link_to article.title, article, class: "text-white underline-offset-4 hover:underline" %></h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-base text-purple-light/70 sm:text-sm">
            <time datetime="<%= article.date.strftime('%Y-%m-%d') %>"><%= article.date.strftime('%B %-e, %Y') %></time>
          </p>
        </article>
      </li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>
  <p class="mt-8">
    <%= link_to "All articles →", "/articles/", class: "text-lime underline decoration-lime/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-lime" %>
  </p>
</section>
